# Sales Analytics Dashboard

## Project Overview
This project presents an interactive Sales Analytics Dashboard developed using Microsoft Excel to analyze sales performance and generate meaningful business insights.

## Tools & Technologies
- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Slicers
- KPI Cards
- Data Visualization

## Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)
- Total Sales
- Total Orders
- Total Quantity
- Total Profit

## Dashboard Features
- Sales performance analysis
- Category-wise sales analysis
- Region-wise sales analysis
- Interactive filters using Slicers
- Visual representation through charts

## Objective
The main objective of this project is to analyze sales data, identify business trends, and support data-driven decision-making.

